    "full_details": "Avisos\nAviso sobre consultas recibidas durante las vacaciones de la Semana Dorada\nIMPORTANTE\n2024-04-26 11:00:00\n(JST/GMT+9)\nGracias por utilizar los servicios y productos de Bandai Namco.\nEl presente es para informar a nuestros usuarios sobre consultas recibidas durante las vacaciones de:\n27 de abril de 2024 (sábado) - 6 de mayo de 2024 (lunes) JST\n■ Please be informed that during the holidy period above, the number of inquiries are expected to increase, so it will take us longer than usual to respond to you.\n■  For some inquiries that needed to be escalated to developers, will be attended from May 7,2024 (Tusesday), and will be answered in order of receipt after the investigation from developers are done properly.\nWe deeply apologize for any inconvenience it will cause you.\nSu comprensión y sus pacientes son muy apreciados.\nIr a la lista de avisos"
